// CloudOptional build profile: CloudKit sync and optional Private Cloud Compute or provider
// adapters (docs/BUILD_AND_DISTRIBUTION.md).
//
// No target attaches yet. A target that attaches this file:
// - declares its own .entitlements file; a CloudKit container entitlement uses
//   $(LAB_CLOUDKIT_CONTAINER_IDENTIFIER), which each developer registers under their own team;
// - is never a dependency of a CoreLocal target, and keeps the local-only path as its fallback;
// - needs a paid team with iCloud for on-device proof: a free Personal Team cannot use iCloud or
//   Push. Private Cloud Compute also depends on program eligibility and distribution.
// Swift code can check `#if LAB_PROFILE_CLOUD_OPTIONAL`.

LAB_BUILD_PROFILE = CloudOptional
LAB_PROFILE_EXTERNAL_SETUP = Paid team with iCloud and your own CloudKit container; per-service eligibility for cloud models
SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = $(inherited) LAB_PROFILE_CLOUD_OPTIONAL
